OL,3,GNEWSASurgeon warns 'nothing has been
OL,4,Alearned' over NHS Grampian safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former senior surgeon has warned that
OL,7,F"nothing has been learned" at NHS
OL,8,FGrampian a decade after he first raised
OL,9,Fconcerns about patient safety and
OL,10,Fclinical governance.
OL,12,FProf Zygmunt Krukowski, who left the
OL,13,Fhealth board in 2015, said it was
OL,14,F"deeply distressing" to see ongoing
OL,15,Ffailings in how major incidents were
OL,16,Finvestigated.
OL,18,FHis comments follow a critical
OL,19,FHealthcare Improvement Scotland (HIS)
OL,20,Freport into the health board, which
OL,21,Fexamined culture, leadership, and
OL,22,Fgovernance.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
