OL,3,GNEWSASurgeon warns 'nothing has been
OL,4,Alearned' over NHS Grampian safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Grampian chief executive Laura
OL,7,FSkaife-Knight said she recognised the
OL,8,Fseriousness of the report and
OL,9,Fapologised to patients and staff for
OL,10,Fthe health board's failings.
